1. GRANT OF LICENSE
xrctl is distributed under two tiers:
(a) Free Core Tier: read-only device discovery, profile lookup, --dry-run
    command previews, 2D restore, and read-only MCP tools.
(b) Pro Tier (Valid Polar.sh License Key Required): 2D/3D SBS mode switching,
    electrochromic tint, 120Hz refresh control, 1000Hz IMU streaming, and Pro
    MCP tools. Open-source builds compiled with -DOSS_EDITION unlock all
    features offline.

